{"id":"43500a42511700ce","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-simplicial-set.md","title":"Definition — 单纯形范畴与单纯集合","display":"Definition — 单纯形范畴与单纯集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-simplicial-set","aliases":["14-df-simplicial-set"],"display":"Definition — 单纯形范畴与单纯集合","source_ref":"I.1, pp.28–29; VIII.7, pp.450–451","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-presheaf-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-simplicial-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-simplicial-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 单纯形范畴与单纯集合"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.1, pp.28–29; VIII.7, pp.450–451"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 采用含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为维数参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。箭头为带源靶的弱递增函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 上的预层候选。</p>\n<p>维数分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> 的定义另假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSimplicialSet}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsSimplicialSet}(S)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；该记号不应用于尚未满足预层条件的候选数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_\\Delta:=\\{[n]\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad M_\\Delta:=\\{([n],[m],u)\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land u:[n]\\to[m]\\land\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i\\le j\\Rightarrow u(i)\\le u(j))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_\\Delta:=\\{[n]\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad M_\\Delta:=\\{([n],[m],u)\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land u:[n]\\to[m]\\land\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i\\le j\\Rightarrow u(i)\\le u(j))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_\\Delta(A,B,u):=A,\\quad t_\\Delta(A,B,u):=B,\\quad i_\\Delta(A):=(A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A),\\quad c_\\Delta((B,C,v),(A,B,u)):=(A,C,v\\circ u),\\quad\\Delta:=(O_\\Delta,M_\\Delta,s_\\Delta,t_\\Delta,i_\\Delta,c_\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_\\Delta(A,B,u):=A,\\quad t_\\Delta(A,B,u):=B,\\quad i_\\Delta(A):=(A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A),\\quad c_\\Delta((B,C,v),(A,B,u)):=(A,C,v\\circ u),\\quad\\Delta:=(O_\\Delta,M_\\Delta,s_\\Delta,t_\\Delta,i_\\Delta,c_\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\Delta)=O_\\Delta,\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Delta}([n],[m])=\\{([n],[m],u)\\in M_\\Delta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ob}(\\Delta)=O_\\Delta,\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Delta}([n],[m])=\\{([n],[m],u)\\in M_\\Delta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_{\\Delta,[n]}=([n],[n],\\operatorname{id}_{[n]}),\\qquad([m],[k],v)\\circ_\\Delta([n],[m],u)=([n],[k],v\\circ u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{id}_{\\Delta,[n]}=([n],[n],\\operatorname{id}_{[n]}),\\qquad([m],[k],v)\\circ_\\Delta([n],[m],u)=([n],[k],v\\circ u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSimplicialSet}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsPresheaf}(S,\\Delta),\\qquad S_n=S([n]),\\qquad\\mathbf{sSet}=\\widehat\\Delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsSimplicialSet}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsPresheaf}(S,\\Delta),\\qquad S_n=S([n]),\\qquad\\mathbf{sSet}=\\widehat\\Delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>弱递增函数对恒等和复合封闭，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 是小范畴。单纯集合的每个单纯形维数及全部面、退化映射由预层函子给出，不需要另造一套无来源的语法。由预层拓扑斯构造，单纯集合范畴是 Grothendieck 拓扑斯。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0]\">\\([0]\\)</span> 非空；空序集不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 的对象。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.1, pp.28–29; VIII.7, pp.450–451。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"S_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSimplicialSet}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"O_\\Delta:=\\{[n]\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad M_\\Delta:=\\{([n],[m],u)\\mid n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land u:[n]\\to[m]\\land\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i\\le j\\Rightarrow u(i)\\le u(j))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s_\\Delta(A,B,u):=A,\\quad t_\\Delta(A,B,u):=B,\\quad i_\\Delta(A):=(A,A,\\operatorname{id}_A),\\quad c_\\Delta((B,C,v),(A,B,u)):=(A,C,v\\circ u),\\quad\\Delta:=(O_\\Delta,M_\\Delta,s_\\Delta,t_\\Delta,i_\\Delta,c_\\Delta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\Delta)=O_\\Delta,\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Delta}([n],[m])=\\{([n],[m],u)\\in M_\\Delta\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_{\\Delta,[n]}=([n],[n],\\operatorname{id}_{[n]}),\\qquad([m],[k],v)\\circ_\\Delta([n],[m],u)=([n],[k],v\\circ u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSimplicialSet}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsPresheaf}(S,\\Delta),\\qquad S_n=S([n]),\\qquad\\mathbf{sSet}=\\widehat\\Delta.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"[0]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false}],"bytes":2275,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-set|df-220 — 单纯形范畴与单纯集合]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-set]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-set]]"},{"id":"c6e4ae351b7d8b03","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-simplicial-set]] 的单纯集合，$S_n=S([n])$。$n,i,j,k$ 均取外部自然数，$\\delta_i^n:[n-1]\\to[n]$、$\\sigma_i^n:[n+1]\\to[n]$ 以及 $d_i^n,s_i^n$ 在下式的明确指标域中定义；复合使用通常从右向左的次序。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-set]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-set|df-220 — 单纯形范畴与单纯集合]]"}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc","300365f146cacc8a"]}